      "english": [
        "E apaayamu, naa gudaaramu sameepinchakunda kaapaaduchuntive",
        "Yehova kaaparigaa – Naa maargamanthatilo",
        "Naa cheyi viduvaka – Nanu dhairya parachi nadipinchuchunnavaadaa",
